Subject: [PATCH] Lichii #949: drain-free semaphore acquires with a 1 ms valve, feed and settle of an idle split back, uniform keeps and image descriptor replay on fast draw delta draws (EDEN_UP_L949_ACQUIRE, EDEN_UP_L949_DRAIN_VALVE, EDEN_UP_SHIP2_FEED, EDEN_UP_L949_UBO_KEEP, EDEN_UP_L949_DESC_REPLAY; all off by default)

Port of zortos293/Lichii #949 (capy/egla66-ship2 by zortos293 / Zortos, merged into nx2 as
a4f6287327 on 9 Nov; "video_core: drain-free semaphore acquires, uniform keeps and descriptor
replay on delta draws"). It carries jpkto's drain-free acquire checks and early publish
(fb4d4e47a7 and 62db242b34, PR #805), PantACRO4life's 1 ms drain valve (b837e742c4) and rdenno's
#639 (23457ccf7b). capy-ai co-authored cf42f364f7, 3e86407514 and b2375cff7f.
Replaces ship2-feed.diff (EDEN_UP_SHIP2_FEED, written on T80, never built): its feed and settle
are in here, rebased onto T83. Do not apply both.

Commit by commit (have = in T83 already):
- d46e17e760 #639 (rdenno): have (merge 7d9823a601; gpu_split.h:66-73 OwnsScheduler,
  gpu_split.cpp:387-407 Drain waits for the idle hook, :779-808 back_quiet, gpu_thread.cpp:112,
  buffer_cache.h:260). Not in this diff.
- cf42f364f7 drain-free acquire checks (jpkto): partly. EDEN_NX2_SEM_FAST (0287) reads the word
  without a drain (puller.cpp:57-102, :264-273, :510-529) but drains whenever any write to the
  16-byte line is queued (puller.cpp:98, 0286 ranges), never passes on a queued release, has no
  per-word write record and does not need front macros. The 3D report notes (maxwell_3d.cpp:1590)
  only feed the off-by-default TrackReleases/DmaReadAhead paths; compute 0x6c3 and copy engine
  semaphores are not noted. Ported: EDEN_UP_L949_ACQUIRE.
- a20471e48c gate + feed + settle: feed and settle missing in T83 (Commit gpu_split.h:573 publishes
  only at publish_every; the pending loop gpu_thread.cpp:151 settles nothing). Ported:
  EDEN_UP_SHIP2_FEED. The gate itself is the switches here.
- 8056420f5b lock-free waiter latches: missing (nx2.h:392-467, Latched takes the mutex at :420).
  Not ported, see below.
- 53bd961ab4 1 ms drain valve: missing (SEM_FAST drains once after 2 s, then never,
  puller.cpp:264-273). Ported: inside EDEN_UP_L949_ACQUIRE, and as EDEN_UP_L949_DRAIN_VALVE for
